.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0426,"r5":0.0461,"r20":-0.078,"r1_spy":0.0406,"r5_spy":0.0281,"r20_spy":-0.0854}},{"id":"YMM 2026 Q2","t":"YMM","d":"2026-08-19","time":"07:00","w":3357,"n":26,"url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/full-truck-alliance-ymm-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0114,"r5":-0.0045,"r20":-0.083,"r1_spy":-0.0135,"r5_spy":-0.0025,"r20_spy":-0.0655}}],"quotes":[{"c":"YMM 2021 Q2","e":"ymm","d":"2021-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hui Zhang","x":"…users through targeted marketing, enhancing the user experience of the registered users by streamlining the delivery process, etc. We believe the impact of the cybersecurity review on our business growth is temporary and our overall business strategy will not be affected in the long…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/10/full-truck-alliance-co-ltd-ymm-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"YMM 2021 Q4","e":"ymm","d":"2022-03-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Simon Cai","x":"…introduced a [Inaudible] share-based matching service to diversify matching methods, rebound, and encouraged adoption of our tap-and-go model with more reasonable pricing to further streamline matching and combine algo to accurately predict and distribute user rewards to guide transaction habits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/01/full-truck-alliance-co-ltd-ymm-q4-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"YMM 2022 Q1","e":"ymm","d":"2022-06-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Simon Cai","x":"As we move forward, we aim to offer a broader range of efficient and user-friendly products and services to streamline logistics transactions while increasing user activity and stickiness.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/06/10/full-truck-alliance-co-ltd-ymm-q1-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"YMM 2022 Q2","e":"ymm","d":"2022-08-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Simon Cai","x":"At the same time, we rolled out a dedicated communication channel for truckers to give direct feedback on low-priced goods or to request price increases on unreasonably priced shipments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/25/full-truck-alliance-co-ltd-ymm-q2-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"YMM 2022 Q3","e":"ymm","d":"2022-11-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mao Mao","x":"Alongside our efforts to expand our monetization channels and improve monetization efficiency, we continued to streamline our operational workflows during the third quarter to enhance our profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/23/full-truck-alliance-co-ltd-ymm-q3-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"YMM 2023 Q2","e":"ymm","d":"2023-08-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Simon Cai","x":"Looking at the transaction types, with rising demand from direct shippers, the proportion of nonnegotiation-based transactions, such as tap and go and entrusted shipment models, continue to increase reflecting our platforms' pricing power and users' enhanced reliance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/23/full-truck-alliance-ymm-q2-2023-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"YMM 2023 Q2","e":"ymm","d":"2023-08-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Simon Cai","x":"It will also send a reminder of the price increase in case there is no transaction within a certain period of time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/23/full-truck-alliance-ymm-q2-2023-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"YMM 2023 Q4","e":"ymm","d":"2024-03-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hui Zhang","x":"Despite the challenges and opportunities present in the external environment, we have adeptly navigated the prevailing trend of efficiency enhancement and cost reduction in the freight industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/03/07/full-truck-alliance-ymm-q4-2023-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"YMM 2023 Q4","e":"ymm","d":"2024-03-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hui Zhang","x":"By embracing the digital transformation of China's growth rate sector, we have positioned ourselves as the leader in online, digital, and intelligent logistics solutions, effectively replacing traditional offline logistics with our core cost saving advantage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/03/07/full-truck-alliance-ymm-q4-2023-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"YMM 2024 Q1","e":"ymm","d":"2024-05-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hui Zhang","x":"With our core cost savings by the proposition and consistently optimized product experience, our network effect is growing stronger at both ends, that is for both truckers and shippers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/21/full-truck-alliance-ymm-q1-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"YMM 2024 Q1","e":"ymm","d":"2024-05-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hui Zhang","x":"As such, we continue to strengthen awareness of FTA's cost-saving benefits for freight shipping.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/21/full-truck-alliance-ymm-q1-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"YMM 2024 Q2","e":"ymm","d":"2024-08-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hui Zhang","x":"Amidst the broader industry trend of cost reduction and efficiency enhancements, we leveraged our [Inaudible] platform skill effect to deliver exceptional cost-effectiveness and transaction efficiency to our users, driving the company's growth flywheel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/21/full-truck-alliance-ymm-q2-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"YMM 2024 Q2","e":"ymm","d":"2024-08-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hui Zhang","x":"Looking ahead, we are confident that we will continue to lead the logistics industry in cost reduction and efficiency improvements through digitization, intelligence, and green practices, creating greater value for all of our users and society as a whole.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/21/full-truck-alliance-ymm-q2-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"YMM 2024 Q3","e":"ymm","d":"2024-11-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hui Zhang","x":"These achievements further underscores our immense value in driving cost savings for shippers, while empowering truckers with more orders, higher turnover, and extra income. [Foreign language] Thanks to our comprehensive operational excellence, our financial results this quarter again exceeded…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/20/full-truck-alliance-ymm-q3-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"YMM 2024 Q3","e":"ymm","d":"2024-11-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Simon Cai","x":"For direct shippers, our R&D team further simplified our order placement interface to streamline the shipping process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/20/full-truck-alliance-ymm-q3-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"YMM 2024 Q4","e":"ymm","d":"2025-03-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Simon Cai","x":"By developing a carpooling model that caters to diversified LTL needs, whether it's short to medium distance or large trade volumes, we have been able to streamline processes by offering a single loading and unloading and door-to-door delivery service.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/05/full-truck-alliance-ymm-q4-2024-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"YMM 2025 Q2","e":"ymm","d":"2025-08-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Simon Cai","x":"While the restructuring of service offerings under the entrusted shipment program led to a short-term slowdown in order volume growth, we believe this strategic adjustment will, over the medium to long term, strengthen user mindset with premium brand positioning, creating differentiated…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/21/full-truck-alliance-ymm-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"YMM 2026 Q1","e":"ymm","d":"2026-05-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chong Cai","x":"…in transparent, efficient and price discovery as fuel prices climbed sharply from March onwards and drove greater freight cost volatility, off-line freight brokers and relationship-based trucking network struggled to pass through these cost increase to shippers in a timely and transparent manner.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/ymm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"YMM 2026 Q1","e":"ymm","d":"2026-05-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chong Cai","x":"Regarding the impact of transportation cost volatility on our platform, we believe that in the near future, the pass-through of higher fuel costs to freight rates may prompt some shippers of low-value goods to reduce or defer shipments, which could lead to some softening in long-haul freight demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/ymm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"YMM 2026 Q1","e":"ymm","d":"2026-05-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chong Cai","x":"Looking ahead, we plan to introduce multimodal capabilities such as screenshot-based posting to further streamline the posting experience while integrating WeCom and open APIs to meet enterprise system integration needs and improve posting efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/25/ymm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[46,1,5393,0,0,0,4774,396],[47,1,4140,0,0,0,3751,211],[48,1,4565,0,0,0,4120,175],[49,1,4296,0,0,0,3807,155],[50,1,4597,0,0,0,3988,349],[51,1,4608,0,0,0,3977,361],[52,1,4756,0,0,0,4263,219],[53,1,4653,0,0,0,4163,259],[54,1,4724,0,0,0,4192,273],[55,1,4581,0,0,0,4069,284],[56,1,4287,0,0,0,3756,320],[57,1,4543,0,0